abstract: >-
  Public evidence library documenting a Detroit charter school network.
  Brian Banks — 9 criminal convictions (6 felony, 3 misdemeanor), claimed
  J.D. never confirmed by the State Bar of Michigan — runs two charter
  schools receiving $4.9M+ in annual public funding. His management
  company receives 72.67% of all revenue. Nine judges across Wayne County
  courts have documented connections to the network. Every fact is cited
  from public records. Every document is timestamped in a git repository.
  94 pages with taxonomy cross-references across actors, entities, courts,
  and connection types.
date-released: "2026-09-20"
